      "extract": "[]{#sect:kappa-sign label=\"sect:kappa-sign\"} For any $a\\in\\textbf{No}$ and $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$, we denote by $\\kappa_{a,n}:=\\log^n(\\kappa_a)$ and $\\kappa_{a,-n}=\\exp^n(\\kappa_a)$, where $\\log^0$ and $\\exp^0$ are equal to the identity map on $\\textbf{No}$. The aim of this section is to show that $\\kappa_{a,n}$ and $\\kappa_{a,-n}$ for any $n$ are elements of $\\omega^{\\omega^{No}}$, and to give their sign sequence. In",
